#!name=Spotify 繁简转换
#!desc=v1.0.2 · 2026-08-16 12:53 · 繁体/简体歌词 → 简体中文(完整歌词 + 底部预览;OpenCC tw2s,本地查表,0 API/0 配额/0 secret)
#!homepage=https://github.com/tedwcy/proxy-plugins/tree/main/loon/spotify-t2s
